    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "むねの　コアが　ガラルちほうの だいちから　わきだす　エネルギーを きゅうしゅうして　かつどうしている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il devient actif en absorbant l’énergie qui émerge du sol de Galar grâce au noyau situé sur sa poitrine.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "The core on its chest absorbs energy emanating from the lands of the Galar region. This energy is what allows Eternatus to stay active.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "胸の　コアが　ガラル地方の 大地から　涌きだす　エネルギーを 吸収して　活動している。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "２まんねんまえに　おちた　いんせきの なかに　いた。　ダイマックスの なぞに　かんけいしている　らしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se trouvait dans une météorite qui s’est écrasée il y a 20 000 ans. Il semble y avoir un lien entre ce Pokémon et le phénomène Dynamax.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It was inside a meteorite that fell 20,000 years ago. There seems to be a connection between this Pokémon and the Dynamax phenomenon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "２万年前に　落ちた　隕石の 中に　いた。　ダイマックスの 謎に　関係している　らしい。",
